    },
    {
     "id": 1173254,
     "content_html": "prevent the resurgence of a Nazi movement in Germany"
    },
    {
     "id": 1173253,
     "content_html": "provide a buffer zone for the United States, preventing a naval attack by the Soviets"
    }
